WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.897
Hi, I'm Sam Ochoa.

00:00:02.947 --> 00:00:05.270
I'm an independent AI researcher, and I set

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:07.910
up AI assistants for small businesses, then

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:09.670
teach the owners to run them.

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:11.670
Here's the problem I keep seeing.

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:13.750
If you run a business with one to twenty five

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:17.057
people, the work that pays is selling, installing,

00:00:17.107 --> 00:00:18.790
and serving your customers.

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:20.950
But the admin eats the day.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.750
The same questions, a quote to chase, notes

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:26.390
to type into the CRM, a pile of forwarded

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:27.270
email.

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:29.190
That time comes straight out of the money

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:29.960
work.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:31.670
So this is what I build.

00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:34.360
An assistant you text, like a coworker.

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:37.110
It runs on a small server you own, not on

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:38.760
somebody else's platform.

00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:40.710
Forward it an email and it texts you a short

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:41.560
summary.

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:44.350
Ask for a checklist, a reminder, a page,

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.550
or a simple tracker, and it builds it for

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:47.270
you.

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:49.190
It learns your business by chatting with

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:49.710
you.

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:52.150
And before anything goes out, a message,

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:55.550
a payment, a post, it asks you first.

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:58.230
You reply yes, and then it happens.

00:00:58.280 --> 00:00:59.670
How I work is simple.

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:01.590
I research your process first.

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:03.830
I set things up inside the tools you already

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.710
use.

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:07.270
Then I teach you to run it yourself, in plain

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:09.030
words, no jargon.

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:11.590
It's for real estate agents, contractors,

00:01:11.640 --> 00:01:14.390
small nonprofits, and insurance offices.

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:16.710
Anyone whose day fills up with admin.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:18.550
If that sounds like your business, book a

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:21.550
fifteen minute call at samuelochoa.com.

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:24.480
I'll tell you honestly whether it's a fit.
